script = ExtResource("1_qr5la")
spell_name = "Phase Collapse"
spell_id = "PHY-SM-002"
spell_icon = ExtResource("2_8ppw2")
spell_flavour_text = "Every system has a temperature at which it can no longer hold its shape. He found yours."
theory_desc = "Phase transitions — matter changes state at critical temperature thresholds releasing or absorbing latent energy. Caster drives the mana structure of everything in the area past its phase transition point: solid defensive structures liquefy (shields break), liquid mana flows disperse (DoT spells detach), gas-phase mana ignites momentarily (stun pulse from latent energy release). A caster who misjudges the phase transition threshold overshoots — triggering collapse in their own mana structure too.
Synergy: Maxwell's Sortition pre-identifies the exact phase threshold — reduces Phase Collapse cast time by 0.6 seconds and eliminates self-collapse risk."
